  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend 2 Fear</strong> to breathe a cloud of toxic smoke in front of the Decay-Bringer within Far range. All targets in that area must make a Strength Reaction Roll. Targets who fail take <strong>3d10+4</strong> magic damage and are <em>Poisoned</em> until their next rest or they succeed on a Knowledge Roll (18). While <em>Poisoned</em>, the target must roll a d6 before they make an action roll. On a result of 4 or lower, they must mark a Stress. Targets who succeed take half damage.</p>",
